        "related_person_ids": [
          "572_278_cba"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 26,
        "end_codepoint": 84,
        "source_quote": "權爲驃騎將軍，辟西曹掾，出爲長沙西部都尉。討平山寇，得精兵萬五千人。後爲濡須都督、奮威將軍，封都鄕侯，領部曲五千人。",
        "reading": "孫權任驃騎將軍時辟承；承在長沙、濡須任官、封都鄕侯。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:reading-084-131",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032",
        "person_id": "roi_rz4_ute_B",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "uti_8b5_tcd",
          "6bl_52a_6nv"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 84,
        "end_codepoint": 131,
        "source_quote": "承爲人壯毅忠讜，能甄識人物，拔彭城蔡款、南陽謝景於孤微童幼，後並爲國士，款至衞尉，景豫章太守。",
        "reading": "蔡款與謝景的出身、薦舉與後來官位分屬二人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:reading-131-159",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032",
        "person_id": "roi_rz4_ute_B",
        "related_person_ids": [
          "512_1cd_a4b"
        ],
        "start_codepoint": 131,
        "end_codepoint": 159,
        "source_quote": "又諸葛恪年少時，眾人奇其英才。承言終敗諸葛氏者，元遜也。",
        "reading": "元遜即諸葛恪；承預言其將敗諸葛氏。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:reading-159-201",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032",
