        "end_codepoint": 270,
        "source_quote": "震諸葛恪誅時亦死。",
        "reading": "震於諸葛恪誅時亦死；原文未詳死法。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032-pei01-01:reading-000-035",
